"""Draft 3: a few token pairs that carry this component's activation.

Negative (strong): the label prefixes "df" and "ax" (Metamath-style theorem names such as
"df-id", "ax-5") and "UTC" when they follow a non-breaking space; mild negative on a
clock "AM"/"PM" after a digit.
