"""A sparse lexical/orthographic detector, not a general semantic classifier.

Large negative outputs mark care/payment/reason collocations, and some
parenting, reproduction and repair vocabulary. Positive outputs mark rate
and protection vocabulary and Greek iota after rho or pi. Several spelling
